{
  "name": "dsh-efficiency",
  "version": "0.11.0",
  "description": "DSH 效率机：①索引并快速定位工具/插件/环境/接口（含宿主 Cordis 服务、Typert Remote、客户端插槽、HTTP 路由），为其他插件高效工作提供支持；②监控运行中的插件/工具/技能等资源调度（进程层 koffi FFI 直读 + 会话层投影差分 + 插件层 Fiber 阶段），检出热点/内存增长/IO 风暴/装载失败等异常，防范卡死崩溃；③记录每个会话的报错并按插件/技能/对象/责任方等切面聚合，做 P0–P3 分级诊断并生成修复提示词，供自修复与自进化；装上即得（自供给 efficiency-lookup 技能 + 三段系统提示词，免改用户任何文件）。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cap.mjs",
    "docs",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "plugin",
    "efficiency",
    "capability",
    "registry",
    "self-aware",
    "resource-monitor",
    "error-ledger",
    "self-repair"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": ">=0.1.7-rc.1",
    "react": "^18.2.0"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-locale": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots": {
      "optional": true
    },
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/capability.test.mjs test/ledger.test.mjs test/efficiency.test.mjs test/client.test.mjs test/fixes.test.mjs"
  }
}
